dLLM Agent — provenance and license notice
==============================================

This implementation was written independently for this project. Its core has
no third-party runtime dependencies and contains no copied or modified source
from the references below. Optional GPU factories call separately installed
Torch, Transformers, and local checkpoints; none are vendored here. Their
respective licenses do not relicense this project.

